  <category name="ReEQ2">
    <reapack name="ReEQ2.jsfx" type="effect" desc="Parametric Graphic Equalizer">
      <version name="2.0.0" author="Justin Johnson" time="2026-10-29T20:00:00Z">
        <changelog><![CDATA[ReEQ2: a new interface, decramped filters to 30 kHz and per-band dynamic EQ
- Redesigned interface: node panel with machined dials, Shape and Stereo pickers, node action card, Analyzer, Settings and Range popovers, gradient meters with clip alerts
- Decramped Ivantsov filters replace the SVFs and Eco/HQ oversampling, matching the analogue curve up to Nyquist
- Per-band dynamic EQ for bells and shelves: threshold, ratio, range, Auto or manual timing, sidechain inputs (channels 3/4, 5/6, 7/8), an unlinked detector with its own node, Listen, and optional lookahead
- Analyser drawn per pixel with Fill, Line and Heat displays; curve-based auto gain; input trim
- Embedded TCP/MCP view
ReEQ 1.2 stays available as its own package; "ReEQ: upgrade ReEQ to ReEQ2" moves projects over with their settings.]]></changelog>
        <source>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Justin-Johnson/ReJJ/v2.0.0/ReEQ2/ReEQ2.jsfx</source>
        <source file="Dependencies/ivantsov_filter.jsfx-inc">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Justin-Johnson/ReJJ/v2.0.0/ReEQ2/Dependencies/ivantsov_filter.jsfx-inc</source>
        <source file="Dependencies/spectrum.jsfx-inc">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Justin-Johnson/ReJJ/v2.0.0/ReEQ2/Dependencies/spectrum.jsfx-inc</source>
      </version>
